slot. for Android: no flash when a Game Boy game turns its screen off.
Pokemon Red, Blue and Yellow turn the screen off at each door while the
next map loads: the blank screen showed for about six frames between two
black ones. The frame before stays (a dupe), and the frame after the
screen comes back on, which the hardware doesn't show either. One line in
the log the first times it happens.

